OL,3,GNEWSAElectric ambulances to be rolled
OL,4,Aout in East Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FElectric vehicles are set to be
OL,7,Fintroduced into East Midlands Ambulance
OL,8,FService's fleet from early 2027.
OL,10,FThe service said it would be receiving
OL,11,F33 vehicles, which would be converted
OL,12,Finto emergency ambulances.
OL,14,FThe vehicles will not be introduced at
OL,15,Fonce, but will come into operation
OL,16,F"gradually" alongside the existing
OL,17,Ffleet, it added.
OL,19,FNHS bosses have set a target for all
OL,20,Fnew ambulances to be zero emission by
OL,21,F2030.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
